        <mxCell id="W0vNndFfA6N3I9zX0p-R-32" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;In the third normal form or 3 N F conversion results, there are 4 tables. Table named project has p r o j underscore n u m as the primary key and p r o j underscore name as the other attribute.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;In the table named employee, e m p underscore n u m is the primary key, whereas e m p underscore name and job underscore class are the other attributes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;In the table named job, the job underscore class is the primary key while c h g underscore hours is the other attribute.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;In the table named, assignment, p r o j underscore num and e m p underscore n u m are the primary keys and assign underscore hours is the other attribute.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
